specific file, directory, or component is expressly identified as
third-party or separately licensed material (see Section 5).

This Software is confidential and proprietary to Onchainfest LLC. It is
made available on a restricted basis and is not open source software.

## 2. No License Granted by Access

Access to this repository — whether through direct grant, an employment
