## 6. Relationship to AOC Protocol

AOC Enterprise is built on top of, and consumes, AOC Protocol — a
separate project with its own repository, contributors, and licensing
terms. This license governs only the AOC Enterprise repository and its
original contents. It does not grant, restrict, claim, or otherwise
affect any rights in AOC Protocol. See
`docs/legal/PROTOCOL_ENTERPRISE_BOUNDARY.md` for the boundary between
the two projects.

